  <text>
    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-610-651">せちになげける秋の木立に、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-651-692">青める月の、病めるいぶき。</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-692-704">風のまに</seg><choice source="#source-704-710"><orig>／＼</orig><reg>〱</reg></choice><seg source="#source-710-744">に、浮びては消ゆる。</seg></p>
      <p>哀れ『世』<seg type="annotated-text" source="#source-762-810"><seg source="#source-759-762">□</seg><note type="gloss"><seg source="#source-783-795">（不明）</seg></note></seg><seg source="#source-810-842">さま、夢かまぼろし、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-842-860">水のおもての</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-860-878"><rb>泡沫</rb><rt>あわ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-878-895">と知れど、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-895-898">『</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-898-913"><rb>生</rb><rt>せい</rt></ruby>』はなほも光をすひぬ。</p>
      <p><seg source="#source-950-974">根もとに重なる、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-974-989"><rb>空</rb><rt>むな</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-989-1003">し朽葉！</seg></p>
      <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1003-1018"><rb>艶</rb><rt>ゑん</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1018-1047">なる夏　夢を埋め、</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-1047-1074">――地下にこゞゑし</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-1074-1092"><rb>都</rb><rt>みやこ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-1092-1110">会もあるや！</seg></p>
    </body>
